<section class="pr-page-hero hp-wrap"><div class="pr-heading" data-reveal><p class="hp-kicker">About THY WILL</p><h1>Care in the details.<br /><span>Confidence in the work.</span></h1><p class="pr-lead">Electrical and construction services for homes and businesses in Durban and the surrounding areas.</p></div><figure class="pr-hero-picture" data-reveal><img src="<%= ResolveUrl("~/Content/images/editorial/technician.jpg") %>" alt="Electrical services and installation" loading="eager" width="1200" height="900" /></figure></section><section class="hp-section hp-wrap pr-story"><p class="hp-kicker" data-reveal>01 / Who we are</p><div data-reveal><h2>A practical approach.<br /><span>A personal commitment.</span></h2><p>THY WILL Electrical &amp; Construction works with residential and commercial customers on electrical installations, maintenance, fault finding and construction needs.</p><p>We start by understanding the work, the property and the people who use it. Safety, clear communication and dependable workmanship guide our approach.</p><a class="hp-text-link" href="~/Public/Services.aspx" runat="server">Explore our services <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></section><section class="pr-image-pair hp-wrap"><figure class="pr-picture" data-reveal><img src="<%= ResolveUrl("~/Content/images/editorial/wiring.jpg") %>" alt="Wiring details during electrical installation" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" /></figure><figure class="pr-picture" data-reveal><img src="<%= ResolveUrl("~/Content/images/editorial/construction.jpg") %>" alt="Construction and installation work" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" /></figure></section><section class="hp-section hp-wrap"><div class="hp-section-head" data-reveal><p class="hp-kicker">02 / Our commitments</p><div><h2>How we approach<br /><span>every assignment.</span></h2></div></div><div class="pr-values"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Understand the requirement.</h3><p>Listen to your concerns, discuss the property and clarify the work involved.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Keep safety central.</h3><p>Consider the installation, the working environment and the people who rely on it.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Keep you informed.</h3><p>Communicate the next steps and support you through the service process.</p></article></div></section><section class="hp-section pr-tinted"><div class="hp-wrap pr-split"><figure class="pr-picture" data-reveal><img src="<%= ResolveUrl("~/Content/images/editorial/installation.jpg") %>" alt="Electrical installation on a building site" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" /></figure><div data-reveal><p class="hp-kicker">03 / Local service</p><h2>Based in Durban.<br /><span>Focused on your property.</span></h2><p>From household wiring and geyser connections to distribution boards and business installations, we help customers in Durban and the surrounding areas arrange the electrical work they need.</p><a class="hp-text-link" href="~/Public/Contact.aspx" runat="server">Talk to our team <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></div></section><section class="pr-cta hp-wrap" data-reveal><p class="hp-kicker">Start a conversation</p><div><h2>Tell us about<br /><span>your next project.</span></h2><a class="hp-button" href="~/Public/Contact.aspx" runat="server">Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></section>
